{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "c020bac9878b411b56b38249769768436a89dd54c84932522c761b07e04b5736", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 2C and 2CR official extractions\n(bounded line-window excerpts, locators preserved; mark-scheme text cited verbatim).\nNo examiner reports consumed; no specimen material cited; supplementary sources not\nconsumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "a92eb1ba6e0463836e6487227027adb230f7a77cd30e470f5e6daf349a9e35d8", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe catalogue covers the alternative classes visible in the pack's excerpt windows;\nrare allowance forms in other sessions are neither catalogued nor denied. The\nhalogen-displacement scheme is quoted from consecutive windows of one item; its full\nguidance grid extends past the excerpt edges and the unexcerpted remainder is not\nparaphrased. No canonical planes were written."}
